6.3 Referential Integrity
Every prerequisite.method_id must exist in method.

Every worked_example.method_id must exist in method.

Every method_relation.method_id and method_relation.related_method_id must exist in method.

Every stag_link.method_id must exist in method.

Every work_link.method_id must exist in method.

Every provenance.method_id must exist in method.

Every moderation.method_id must exist in method.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The method relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

